  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p><a href=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1-scaled.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-1219\" src=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" srcset=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1-300x169.jpg 300w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1-768x432.jpg 768w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1-1140x641.jpg 1140w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1-720x405.jpg 720w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1-24x14.jpg 24w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1-36x20.jpg 36w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1-48x27.jpg 48w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a> <a href=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2-scaled.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-1220\" src=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" srcset=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2-300x169.jpg 300w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2-768x432.jpg 768w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2-1140x641.jpg 1140w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2-720x405.jpg 720w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2-24x14.jpg 24w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2-36x20.jpg 36w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2-48x27.jpg 48w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a> <a href=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/3.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-1221\" src=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/3-225x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/3-225x300.jpg 225w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/3-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/3-18x24.jpg 18w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/3-27x36.jpg 27w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/3-36x48.jpg 36w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/3.jpg 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\" /></a> <a href=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/4.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-1222\" src=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/4-225x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/4-225x300.jpg 225w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/4-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/4-18x24.jpg 18w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/4-27x36.jpg 27w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/4-36x48.jpg 36w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/4.jpg 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\" /></a></p>\n<p>አዲስ አበባ | መስከረም 24 ቀን 2019 ዓ.ም</p>\n<p>የዘውዲቱ መሸሻ የህጻናትና ቤተሰብ የበጎ አድራጎትና ልማት ማህበር መስራች የሆኑት እመበረከት ዘውዲቱ መሸሻ 85ኛ የልደት በዓላቸው የረጅም ዓመታት የበጎ አድራጎት አስተዋጽኦአቸውን፣ ለህጻናትና ለተቸገሩ ወገኖች ያደረጉትን የላቀ ውለታ በሚያስታውስ መልኩ በደማቅ ሁኔታ ተከብሯል።</p>\n<p>በዓሉ በብጹዕ አቡነ ፊሊጶስ የደቡብ ኦሞ ሀ/ስብከት ሊቀ ጳጳስና የቅድስት ስላሴ መንፈሳዊ ዩኒቨርሲቲ ፕሬዝዳንት፣ መጋቢ ሀዲስ እሸቱ፣ የክብር እንግዶች፣ የድርጅቱ ደጋፊዎች፣ ሰራተኞች እና በማዕከሉ ህጻናት ተሳትፎ በደስታና በፍቅር ተከብሯል። የተለያዩ የማህበረሰቡ አካላት በተገኙበት የተካሄደው ይህ ልዩ በዓል፣ ለመስራቿ ያለውን ክብር፣ ፍቅርና አድናቆት የገለጸ የደስታ ቀን ሆኖ አልፏል። በዚሁ እለት በተለያዩ የሙያ ዘርፍና ደረጃ የተመረቁ ተማሪዎች፣ ከፍተኛ ውጤት ላስመዘገቡ ልጆች የዕውቅናና የሽልማት ስነ ስርዓት በማርያም ወዳጆች ተካሂዷል፡፡</p>\n<p>እመበረከት ዘውዲቱ መሸሻ በረጅም ዓመታት የበጎ አድራጎት ተግባራቸው ለብዙ ህጻናት የተስፋ፣ የእንክብካቤና የአዲስ ሕይወት መሠረት ለመሆን ችለዋል። የህጻናትን ደህንነት፣ እድገትና የወደፊት ሕይወት ለማሻሻል ያደረጉት ጥረት ለብዙዎች አርአያ የሚሆን የሰብዓዊነትና የርህራሄ ተግባር ነው።</p>\n<p>በዓሉ የመስራቿን የሕይወት ጉዞና የበጎ አድራጎት አሻራ ከማስታወስ ባሻገር፣ ለህጻናት ደህንነትና ለተቸገሩ ወገኖች ድጋፍ በጋራ መቆም ያለውን ትልቅ ፋይዳ የሚያሳይ አጋጣሚ ነበር።</p>\n<p>ድርጅታችን በበዓሉ በመገኘት ደስታቸውን ለተጋሩ፣ ለመስራቿ ክብር ለሰጡ እንግዶች፣ ለደጋፊዎች፣ ለሰራተኞችና ለሁሉም ተሳታፊዎች ልባዊ ምስጋናውን ያቀርባል።</p>\n<p><strong>እመበረከት ዘውዲቱ መሸሻ እንኳን ለ85ኛ የልደት በዓልዎ አደረስዎ! ረጅም ዕድሜ ከጤና፣ ከሰላም፣ ከደስታና ከበረከት ጋር</strong> <strong>እንዲሰጥዎ</strong> <strong>እንመኝልዎታለን።</strong></p>\n<p>ለበለጠ መረጃና ድጋፍ ለማድረግ፦</p>\n<p>Websit: https://zewditumeshesha.org/</p>\n<p>Telegram: t.me/+pMFeQ3LZ-WliNmRk</p>\n<p>YouTube: youtube.com/@ZEWDITUASSOCIATION</p>\n<p>TikTok: <a href=\"mailto:tiktok.com/@zewditumesaha\">tiktok.com/@zewditumesaha</a></p>\n",
